Origin: EmberBSD; AI-assisted repair for ngspice 47.
License: Same terms as the patched upstream file.
Do not select Linux procfs from an absolute build-host file in a BSD cross build.
Keep the existing Linux/Cygwin probe and the existing BSD memory-query paths.

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -730,8 +730,10 @@
         ;;
     * )
 
-# Check for /proc (virtual process information file system)
-AC_CHECK_HEADERS([/proc/meminfo])
+# Only these target systems use the Linux-compatible procfs memory layout.
+# An absolute header probe can otherwise inspect the build host during cross builds.
+AS_CASE([$host_os], [linux*|cygwin*],
+    [AC_CHECK_HEADERS([/proc/meminfo])])
 
